lan-route-fixer (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Generalize the tool beyond Deskflow to any local LAN destination.
  * Add CLI mode and GUI-independent core module.
  * Batch privileged route changes into one helper invocation.
  * Detect interfaces from link type and local subnet automatically.
  * Accept private IPv4 CIDRs and ULA/link-local IPv6 destinations.

 -- pychen117 <pychen117@163.com>  Mon, 01 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800
